WEBVTT

00:00:02.046 --> 00:00:02.743
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.867 --> 00:00:11.346
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> ‘Mr Watson,’ she said slowly, ‘I am beginning to understand.’

00:00:13.166 --> 00:00:13.725
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.158 --> 00:00:20.326
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> ‘Sit down,’ he said calmly, ‘and tell me what you know.’

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.274
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:24.306 --> 00:00:27.024
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> ‘Catherine,’ he said nervously.

00:00:27.926 --> 00:00:31.886
‘There’s something I have to tell you.’

00:00:33.948 --> 00:00:34.636
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:35.725 --> 00:00:39.001
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> ‘Here you are,’ the old woman said kindly.

00:00:39.652 --> 00:00:41.712
‘A nice cup of tea for you.’

00:00:43.844 --> 00:00:44.610
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:45.755 --> 00:00:49.025
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> The detective looked at her suspiciously.

00:00:50.535 --> 00:00:58.419
‘Tell me, what were you doing at 12.00 on 11th May?’